cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >
  If you use this dataset in your research, journalism, or creative work,
  please cite it as below. Attribution is required under the CC-BY 4.0 licence.
type: dataset
title: "Sackar Atlas: A Public Record of the NSW LGBTIQ Hate Crimes Inquiry"
abstract: >
  An open dataset making the findings of the 2023 NSW Special Commission of
  Inquiry into LGBTIQ Hate Crimes (Sackar Inquiry) navigable to a general
  audience. Structured across cases, locations, events, people, and sources —
  every claim sourced to the primary record. Published under CC-BY 4.0 for use
  by researchers, journalists, community organisations, and the public.
authors:
